# Native-run traces are written here by driver.js, native-run.mjs and corrections.js.
#
# Generated traces are not part of the repository. Claude's plugin directory counts every
# file, and this store is thousands of JSON traces. Scripts still write here locally.
# No workflow reads this directory back, so the traces are not uploaded from CI.
#
# The published 2.0.0 traces, including the two corrections the journey tests bind to by
# digest, stay tracked. A new file is ignored unless it is listed below.
*
